<title>HONG KONG: HK futures exchange to name future CEO on Tuesday.</title>
<headline>HK futures exchange to name future CEO on Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Hong Kong Futures Exchange said on Monday it would name the person designated to be its future chief executive officer at a news conference on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The appointee would take up the position from the start of 1998, after Ivers Riley, the present chief executive officer, retires at the end of 1997, a spokesman at the exchange said.</p>
<p>--Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 28436441</p>
</text>
